  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Agency for Technical and Cooperation Development for emergency livelihoods assistance for conflict-affected communities in North Pakistan; and flood-resistant shelter for 2012 flood-affected people</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to Agency for Technical and Cooperation Development for emergency livelihoods assistance for conflict-affected communities in North Pakistan; and flood-resistant shelter for 2012 flood-affected people is a component of PREDICTABLE HUMANITARIAN EMERGENCIES IN PAKISTAN DURING 2013 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 105 -  Humanitarian assistance and a budget of &#xa3;6,000,000. It works in the following sector(s): Immediate post-emergency reconstruction and rehabilitation.</narrative>
  </description>
